        // Access History(length-1).Val via the Log public getter: History(uint) returns (Sender, Data, Val, Time)
        // But C's Log contract is in the provided source; its History public getter returns the struct; solidity auto-generated
        // getter signature: function History(uint) public view returns (address, string memory, uint, uint)
